  "id": "bug/2026-11-18_1751_sqlite-wal-data-loss",
  "category": "bug",
  "title": "SQLite 数据丢失：WAL 未落盘与旧库导入默认关闭",
  "createdAt": "2026-11-18T17:51:21+08:00",
  "session": {
    "agentModel": "unknown",
    "promptSummary": "SQLite 数据丢失：WAL 未落盘与旧库导入默认关闭",
    "toolCallCount": 0
  },
  "problem": "SQLite 切库后旧库 WAL 未 checkpoint 落盘、且 importLegacy 默认关闭，导致历史数据（run_ledger/token_usage/conversations 等）在迁移后不可见，表现为数据丢失",
  "solution": "新增 SqliteWalCheckpointer 启动即对统一库执行 wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)；LegacySqliteImporter 导入后 checkpoint 并对跳过表显式告警计数、保留 INSERT OR IGNORE 防覆盖；AgentDbProperties.importLegacy 默认改为 true；DataSourceConfig 注册 Bean；application.yml 支持 AGENT_DB_IMPORT_LEGACY 覆盖",
